 n a Big Ten showdown. With conference pride on the line and both teams loo
 king to make their mark on the season\, expect plenty of energy from kicko
 ff through the final whistle.\n\nCatch every play on the big screen at The
  Pub\, with game-day favorites from the menu and beer on tap throughout th
 e game. Settle in with fellow members\, pick your side\, and enjoy an afte
 rnoon of Big Ten football\, spirited rivalry\, and plenty to cheer about.
URL:https://members.thequinhouse.com/events/203030
CATEGORIES:Sports & Games
