 : 4 spots left\nStatus: Available\nEvent URL: https://members.thequinhouse
 .com/events/203329\n\nStep into a lively evening designed for members in t
 heir 40s\, where meaningful connections come naturally and conversation fl
 ows as effortlessly as the wine. This Serendipity Dinner invites you to ga
 ther in The Muse for a relaxed yet refined evening alongside fellow member
 s.\n\nThe experience unfolds over a thoughtfully curated three-course menu
