LOCATION:Scottie's
DESCRIPTION:Category: The Arts\nPrice: Free\nStatus: Waitlist Only\nEvent U
 RL: https://members.thequinhouse.com/events/203608\n\nOrlando Baxter bring
 s his sharp\, deeply relatable comedy to The ’House for an evening of st
 and-up inspired by family\, relationships\, work\, and the everyday absurd
 ities of life. A former public high school teacher\, Orlando spent 12 year
 s in the classroom—an experience that continues to shape his quick wit\,
  natural storytelling\, and unmistakable point of view.\n\nSince trading l
 esson plans for the stage\, Orlando has entertained audiences around the w
 orld\, appeared on Conan\, and earned more than five million views for his
  comedy special\, Glorified Baby Sitter.\n\nEnjoy a pre-show cocktail from
  the cash bar before settling in for the performance. Seating is first com
 e\, first served.\n\nMake a night of it with a burger and beer in The Pub 
 before the show. Dining walk-ins are welcome.\n\n*This event is available 
 for members and up to one registered guest. Complimentary light bites and 
 refreshments will be served. We kindly ask that all cancellations be made 
 at least 24 hours prior to the start of the event.
URL:https://members.thequinhouse.com/events/203608
CATEGORIES:The Arts
