BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:quin-event-200238@thequinhouse.com
DTSTAMP:20261203T150000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261203
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261209
SUMMARY:'Venture: European Holiday Markets
LOCATION:Offsite: Strasbourg\, Nuremberg\, Vienna\, and Munich
DESCRIPTION:Category: ‘Venture - Travel\nPrice: $10150.00 per person\nAva
 ilability: 2 spots left\nStatus: Available\nTime: 3 PM – 12 PM\nEvent UR
 L: https://members.thequinhouse.com/events/200238\n\nThis December\, trade
  the usual holiday routine for a ‘Venture through the heart of Europe du
 ring its most magical season. Wander Strasbourg’s storybook streets\, ex
 perience Nuremberg’s legendary Christkindlesmarkt\, revel in the grandeu
 r of Vienna\, and savor a final taste of Bavaria in Munich. With exception
 al dining\, luxury accommodations\, private transportation\, and time to d
 iscover each destination at leisure\, every detail has been thoughtfully c
 onsidered. \n\nBegin in the heart of Alsace\, with two days to wander Str
 asbourg’s celebrated holiday markets\, half-timbered streets\, artisan s
 talls\, and historic landmarks\, gathering over Alsatian fare in centuries
 -old settings along the way. From there\, journey east to Nuremberg and th
 e legendary Christkindlesmarkt\, one of the world’s oldest holiday marke
 ts\, with time to explore the medieval Old Town\, Imperial Castle\, and st
 alls beneath the Frauenkirche before an evening of Franconian specialties.
 \n\nThe journey continues to Vienna\, where imperial landmarks\, elegant b
 oulevards\, and enchanting holiday markets set the scene for an afternoon 
 in one of Europe’s grandest capitals. Finally\, Bavaria provides a fitti
 ng finale in Munich. Wander from Marienplatz to the Viktualienmarkt\, disc
 over neighborhood markets and local boutiques\, and savor one last taste o
 f the season before raising a glass together over a farewell dinner overlo
 oking the National Theatre. An extraordinary journey through the tradition
 s\, flavors\, and unmistakable magic of the European holiday season awaits
 .\n\nSingle Occupancy | $6\,950\n\nDouble Occupancy | $10\,150\n\n*Reserva
 tions are non-refundable and non-transferable in order to guarantee accom
 modations during the high season. Payment is due in full at the time of bo
 oking. To ensure the best possible experience for all attendees\, we kind
 ly ask that members inform us in advance of any physical limitations\, mob
 ility considerations\, or accessibility needs we should be aware of. All m
 embers will also be asked to sign The 'Quin's standard liability agreement
  in advance of travel and minimum interest must be met to ensure the trip 
 will proceed as planned.
URL:https://members.thequinhouse.com/events/200238
CATEGORIES:‘Venture - Travel
END:VEVENT
END:VCALENDAR
